<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50, instances 1.00 higher. Demand moderate to good. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 60.00-61.00, few 60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 59.00-60.00</p>
<p>Sows: Mostly 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
